UiHostingGap status open.
UiHostingGap affects UI.
UiHostingGap describes "Go host process versus embedded library/native/browser allocation; preserve BWEB duties and app-context separation.".
StemServiceSplitGap status open.
StemServiceSplitGap affects StemProfile.
StemServiceSplitGap describes "Separate service extraction is unresolved; current accountability remains inside BuckingService.".
AptServiceSplitGap status open.
AptServiceSplitGap affects AptDomain.
AptServiceSplitGap describes "Persistent library, active definition and draft ownership split is unresolved; no new APT service assumed.".
PresentationWireGap status open.
PresentationWireGap affects PresentationContract.
PresentationWireGap describes "Exact versioned schema/patch/intent/result payloads, compatibility negotiation and resync must be defined.".
OperatorBrowserSchemaGap status open.
OperatorBrowserSchemaGap affects OperatorBrowserContract.
OperatorBrowserSchemaGap describes "Complete browser schema/recovery contracts beyond baseline intent are not available as a frozen full-system schema.".
AptEditSchemaGap status open.
AptEditSchemaGap affects EditAptDraft.
AptEditSchemaGap describes "Existing Bucking command schema has import/export but not the complete selected draft edit/store lifecycle.".
AptActivationGap status open.
AptActivationGap affects ActivateAptDefinition.
AptActivationGap describes "Reconcile existing AptImportCommand.activate with distinct explicit activation, economic policy and revision preconditions.".
NewStanfordCodecGap status open.
NewStanfordCodecGap affects ImportAptDefinition.
NewStanfordCodecGap describes "Select actual supported newer standard/version/corpus; preserve differing semantics rather than inventing a generic new-standard codec.".
PresentationRaceGap status open.
PresentationRaceGap affects PublishPresentationRevision.
PresentationRaceGap describes "Compare-and-publish check point, atomicity scope and reject/retry policy when Composition changes must be selected.".
TransientEditGap status open.
TransientEditGap affects PreservePresentationContinuity.
TransientEditGap describes "Focus, scroll and unsubmitted local text retention/disposition across incompatible schema swaps needs product policy.".
CollectionTaxonomyGap status open.
CollectionTaxonomyGap affects PatchRepresentationCollection.
CollectionTaxonomyGap describes "Table versus List<Record>, sparse Matrix and action-capable cells remain unresolved; no imaginary universal collection API.".
DeliveryBudgetGap status open.
DeliveryBudgetGap affects DeliveryScheduler.
DeliveryBudgetGap describes "Concrete queue/memory/work limits, cadence and overflow behavior require measured acceptance targets.".
JournalScopeGap status open.
JournalScopeGap affects CommonServiceContract.
JournalScopeGap describes "Production durability and event ordering scopes are not equivalent to mandatory global event sourcing; exact per-owner journal policy is open.".
ProductionProvenanceGap status open.
ProductionProvenanceGap affects ProductionRecordValue.
ProductionProvenanceGap describes "Complete cut lineage/persistence contract is not supplied by the small existing ProductionEvent wire record.".
P1000EvidenceGap status open.
P1000EvidenceGap affects AdvanceP1000Protocol.
P1000EvidenceGap describes "Full physical protocol/control behaviors require address/capture-backed evidence beyond MachineService-Lite; unsupported behavior stays unavailable.".
ExecutablePredicateGap status open.
ExecutablePredicateGap affects MVP1.
ExecutablePredicateGap describes "Condition prose, function specifications and state initializers are not executable expressions. Cannot lower this complete design draft to executable IR yet.".
SourceBindingGap status open.
SourceBindingGap affects MVP1.
SourceBindingGap describes "Target responsibilities exceed observed source implementations; exact revision/symbol/test bindings remain partial.".
PermissiveContractGap status open.
PermissiveContractGap affects PermissiveContract.
PermissiveContractGap describes "External presence/permissive payload, identity, freshness and failure response need their own contract.".
PhysicalTxGate status open.
PhysicalTxGate affects GatePhysicalWrite.
PhysicalTxGate describes "End-to-end sender/socket/target expiry and separate physical authorization are unmet; no hardware output is enabled.".
LibraryAllocationGap status open.
LibraryAllocationGap affects UIRuntime.
LibraryAllocationGap describes "Reusable stateful definitions need explicit per-application instantiation and lifecycle in the eventual allocation grammar.".
RendererFailureGap status open.
RendererFailureGap affects ObserveRenderedRevision.
RendererFailureGap describes "Post-publication renderer failure/recovery and display acknowledgment semantics are not settled by schema validity.".
DomainAlgorithmBindingGap status open.
DomainAlgorithmBindingGap affects TaperModels.
DomainAlgorithmBindingGap describes "Exact versioned numerical/codec call signatures, precision and parity fixtures must be bound before executable lowering.".
ShutdownCoordinationGap status open.
ShutdownCoordinationGap affects ShutdownSystem.
ShutdownCoordinationGap describes "Allocated instance selection, quiescence order, durable drain deadlines and cleanup after a component failure need a system lifecycle contract; an ordered design walkthrough is not proof of all-resource shutdown.".
